<title>FRANCE: MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS FRENCH 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS FRENCH 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>LE CASTELLET, France 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Michael Doohan, riding a Honda, won the 500cc French motorcycling Grand Prix on Sunday.</p>
<p>Spain's Carlos Checa was second and Japan's Tadayuki Okada was third.</p>
</text>
